	)
	(text_box "10 MHz sine from a GPSDO (0.3 V peak or more), or any 0.5 to 3.3 V square wave to 80 MHz. 50 Ω if the shunt is in. AC coupled into a TLV3501 comparator on the ADC's low-noise 3.3 V:\n+IN biased to mid-rail through 10 kΩ, -IN at mid-rail, 6 mV of hysteresis inside, 4.5 ns. The FPGA's PLL locks to it (8 MHz minimum)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 198.12 0)
		(size 152.4 6.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
