		)
		(uuid "ca171418-2dba-a24e-3248-4d4df11fc220")
	)
	(text_box "JTAG header: the same four signals the FT2232H drives (USB sheet).\nTCK pulled down, TMS/TDI/TDO pulled up (Lattice checklist).\nTo use an external programmer here, fit JP501 FTDI OFF (USB sheet) first:\nit holds the FT2232H in reset, so its TXD / TCK output cannot fight.\nThese four local labels and the SDRAM bus members\nare the only labels on this sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 539.75 351.79 0)
		(size 60.96 12.7)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8b53683-0f30-a281-0096-6f8e6bc6b2f7")
	)
	(text_box "Pmod sockets, 0.9 inch apart on the board edge so a double-width module spans both.\n33 Ω series; Pmod pins 1-4 = IO0-3, 7-10 = IO4-7, 5/11 ground, 6/12 3.3 V\n(pads 1,3,5,7 / 2,4,6,8 / 9,10 / 11,12 in KiCad's odd/even numbering).\nBoth buses are drawn; the labels on the socket end are the same bus members."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 599.44 547.37 0)
		(size 72.39 8.89)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e991890e-e97a-1d35-9479-f30151e0d46b")
	)
	(text_box "One box per I/O bank, in the position the bank has on the package:\n7 and 6 on the west (ADC above, DAC below); 0 and 1 on the north (clocks, I2C, LEDs, buttons; the SDRAM);\n2 and 3 on the east (Ethernet and HDMI; SD card, USB, serial, Pmods); 8 on the south (sysCONFIG: SPI flash, JTAG, slow controls).\nEvery ball is named by its ball number; a PCLK is a primary clock input.\nThe pin plan is generated (gen/fpga.py) and the same table writes the .lpf and the LiteX platform file."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(size 129.54 12.7)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
